       "```wandb.init(project='affinage-factures', config={'lr': 2e-4, 'r': 16, 'epochs': 2})\nfor step, loss in entrainement():\n    wandb.log({'loss': loss, 'lr': sched.get_last_lr()[0]}, step=step)\nwandb.log({'exactitude_test': 0.87})",
